{"title":"Okkana-sensei","ru":"Okkana-sensei","kind":"character","url":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/Okkana-sensei","blocks":[{"tag":"p","text":"Okkana-sensei (おっかな先生) — мужчина Tamagotchi, тренер по физкультуре в школе ДориТама. Он дебютировал на Tamagotchi P's и появился в GO-GO Tamagotchi! аниме."},{"tag":"h2","text":"О персонаже"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Стадия роста"},{"tag":"p","text":"Взрослая форма"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Родной город"},{"tag":"p","text":"Город мечты"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Актер озвучки аниме"},{"tag":"p","text":"Сугуру Иноуэ"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Электронные питомцы"},{"tag":"p","text":"Мужчина:"},{"tag":"li","text":"Tamagotchi P's (NPC)"},{"tag":"li","text":"Tamagotchi 4U (NPC)"},{"tag":"li","text":"Tamagotchi 4U+ (NPC)"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Аниме"},{"tag":"p","text":"Мужчина:"},{"tag":"li","text":"ВПЕРЕД Tamagotchi!"},{"tag":"h2","text":"Внешность"},{"tag":"p","text":"Okkana-sensei имеет розовую кожу и темно-розовый клюв. Его голова квадратной формы, у него колючие волосы и челка. Его глаза выглядят как полукруги, а в аниме у него голубые радужки. Он носит красную рубашку и красные брюки."},{"tag":"h2","text":"Характер"},{"tag":"p","text":"Okkana-sensei полон энтузиазма и энергии. Он очень увлечен своим классом. Он поощряет и бросает вызов своим ученикам."},{"tag":"h2","text":"О виртуальных питомцах"},{"tag":"h3","text":"Tamagotchi P's"},{"tag":"p","text":"Okkana-sensei можно увидеть преподающим физкультуру в Школе Мечты, если Tamagotchi ходит туда."},{"tag":"h3","text":"Tamagotchi 4U/4U+"},{"tag":"p","text":"Okkana-sensei преподает спортивный урок в школе Доритама."},{"tag":"h2","text":"В аниме"},{"tag":"h3","text":"ВПЕРЕД Tamagotchi!"},{"tag":"p","text":"Okkana-sensei появился в «Fierce Fight! World Tama Cup». Он делит класс на три команды и устраивает для них полосу препятствий."},{"tag":"h2","text":"Галерея"},{"tag":"h3","text":"Иллюстрации"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Happy"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Тренировка матча по регби"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Картинка ко Дню учителя 2023"},{"tag":"h3","text":"Аниме"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Okkana-sensei подбадриваем учеников"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Подготовка к старту гонки"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Плачут слезы счастья"}],"imageSource":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:RugbyMatchArtwork.jpg","gallery":[{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Okkana_happy.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/d5/Okkana_happy.png/revision/latest?cb=20161001045438","caption":"Радуется"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/80/80de308e1450eb1a752b.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:RugbyMatchArtwork.jpg","caption":"Игра в регби"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamaTeacherAppreciationArtwork.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/04/TamaTeacherAppreciationArtwork.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20231008033357","caption":"Картинка ко Дню учителя 2023","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/04/TamaTeacherAppreciationArtwork.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20231008033357"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Okana_cheering.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/17/Okana_cheering.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141027173530","caption":"Okkana-sensei подбадриваем учеников","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/17/Okana_cheering.png/revision/latest?cb=20141027173530"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Okana_race.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8f/Okana_race.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141027173612","caption":"Подготовка к старту гонки","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/8f/Okana_race.png/revision/latest?cb=20141027173612"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Okana_happy_tears.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2b/Okana_happy_tears.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20141027173641","caption":"Плачут слезы счастья","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2b/Okana_happy_tears.png/revision/latest?cb=20141027173641"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Okana_sensei_artwork.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/94/Okana_sensei_artwork.png/revision/latest?cb=20150116163434","caption":"Иллюстрация · Okkana-sensei"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:OkkanaPsSprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/4d/OkkanaPsSprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220708172839","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Okkana-sensei","sprite":true}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-4u-e5ac81","title":"Tamagotchi 4U","ru":"Tamagotchi 4U","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-4u-bcca85","title":"Tamagotchi 4U+","ru":"Tamagotchi 4U+","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-p-s-c8135a","title":"Tamagotchi P's","ru":"Tamagotchi P's","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"}]}